      "content": "idk, i dont know if moving forward even makes sense. everything feels so hollow. sometimes i feel like the idea of just... fading out... isn't even a bad thing. it feels more natural than trying to fight the tide. like, if there's no anchor, isn't it easier to just let the current take you wherever?",
